---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Pricing" description="qyl is free: the Collector, the hosted MCP endpoint, the qyl plugin and the local MCP server.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="site-shell pricing-shell">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">One plan · every shipped feature</span>
        <h1 class="page-title">qyl is free.</h1>
        <p class="lede">No feature matrix and no pretend enterprise tier. Run the Collector yourself, or connect your agent to the hosted endpoint.</p>
      </div>
      <article class="pricing-card" aria-labelledby="free-plan">
        <div class="pricing-card__head">
          <span>Everything included</span>
          <div class="price"><strong>€0</strong><small>today</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-card__body">
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>NativeAOT Collector: OTLP trace, log and metric ingestion and analysis</li>
            <li>Hosted MCP endpoint: every read tool, annotations, saved queries and failure status</li>
            <li>MCP Events for new error traces</li>
            <li>The qyl plugin for Claude Code and Codex, and the ChatGPT connector</li>
            <li>The local stdio MCP server</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="button button--light" href="/docs/getting-started/" id="free-plan">Install qyl</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="editorial-section editorial-section--raised">
    <div class="site-shell section-intro">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">The plain answer</span><h2 class="section-title">No billing system is hidden behind this page.</h2></div>
      <p class="lede">qyl is solo-developed. If pricing ever changes, the terms and limits will be published before anyone is charged. The local Collector remains useful without a hosted account.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
